  "lectures": [
    {
      "id": "39835916",
      "title": "Module Introduction & Starting Project",
      "sourceHash": "ed09be9edc7424d1063ff1e59d2d2ab7be0bfd7db3d0da6fbd318b8be11740a5",
      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 0.81,
          "end": 3.39,
          "en": "Now that you've got a solid foundation",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.39,
          "end": 7.56,
          "en": "and a solid understanding of how to build Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 7.56,
          "end": 10.2,
          "en": "how to work with Components and so on,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 10.2,
          "end": 11.94,
          "en": "it's time to also take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 11.94,
          "end": 16.94,
          "en": "at styling Components and styling React apps in general.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.67,
          "end": 21.15,
          "en": "Now, of course, this is not a CSS course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 21.15,
          "end": 23.01,
          "en": "and therefore this course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.01,
          "end": 27.93,
          "en": "and also this section here is not about teaching you CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.93,
          "end": 29.46,
          "en": "I got a dedicated course",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 29.46,
          "end": 32.223,
          "en": "about that if you wanna learn more about CSS.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 33.36,
          "end": 36.72,
          "en": "But, of course, as a React developer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 36.72,
          "end": 40.89,
          "en": "you should know how you can generally apply CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 40.89,
          "end": 42.99,
          "en": "to your React Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 42.99,
          "end": 46.23,
          "en": "because as you will learn in this course section,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 46.23,
          "end": 48.78,
          "en": "there exist different options",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 48.78,
          "end": 52.26,
          "en": "with different advantages and disadvantages",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 52.26,
          "end": 55.653,
          "en": "when it comes to styling React absent Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 56.49,
          "end": 59.73,
          "en": "And therefore, in this section we'll take a look",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 59.73,
          "end": 64.35,
          "en": "at styling React apps with Vanilla CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 64.35,
          "end": 66.3,
          "en": "so with just CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 66.3,
          "end": 70.95,
          "en": "without any special extra packages or features.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 70.95,
          "end": 73.56,
          "en": "But we're thereafter going to take a look at",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 73.56,
          "end": 76.44,
          "en": "a couple of more advanced techniques",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 76.44,
          "end": 78.87,
          "en": "and extra packages you can use",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 78.87,
          "end": 81.33,
          "en": "for styling your Components.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 81.33,
          "end": 84.48,
          "en": "For example, you will learn how to scope your styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 84.48,
          "end": 88.17,
          "en": "to certain Components with CSS modules,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 88.17,
          "end": 92.07,
          "en": "and you'll see what scoping means in this section as well.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 92.07,
          "end": 93.66,
          "en": "You will also learn about",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 93.66,
          "end": 98.16,
          "en": "a popular CSS in JavaScript styling package",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 98.16,
          "end": 100.11,
          "en": "called Styled Components,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 100.11,
          "end": 101.82,
          "en": "and you'll learn how that works",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 101.82,
          "end": 104.94,
          "en": "and what the advantages of this approach are.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 104.94,
          "end": 107.49000000000001,
          "en": "And, of course, also about the disadvantages,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 107.49000000000001,
          "end": 110.31,
          "en": "as for all those approaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 110.31,
          "end": 114.237,
          "en": "and I'll introduce you to Tailwind CSS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 114.237,
          "end": 118.65,
          "en": "and to styling your React apps with Tailwind CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 118.65,
          "end": 121.71,
          "en": "since this is also a super popular choice",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 121.71,
          "end": 125.1,
          "en": "when it comes to styling React applications.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 125.1,
          "end": 128.43,
          "en": "And, of course, for all these different approaches,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 128.43,
          "end": 130.23,
          "en": "I will show you how to apply",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 130.23,
          "end": 133.26,
          "en": "both static styles that never change",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 133.26,
          "end": 136.41,
          "en": "and dynamic or conditional styles",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 136.41,
          "end": 138.15,
          "en": "that should only be applied",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 138.15,
          "end": 140.613,
          "en": "when certain circumstances are met.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 141.6,
          "end": 145.59,
          "en": "Now as basically for all the sections in this course,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 145.59,
          "end": 148.35,
          "en": "this course comes with a starting project,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 148.35,
          "end": 149.73,
          "en": "which you find attached,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 149.73,
          "end": 153.32999999999998,
          "en": "both a local version and a link to CodeSandbox",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 153.32999999999998,
          "end": 155.64,
          "en": "if you wanna follow along there.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 155.64,
          "end": 158.34,
          "en": "As always, if you're using the local version,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 158.34,
          "end": 159.9,
          "en": "download and extract it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 159.9,
          "end": 164.46,
          "en": "then run npm install once to install all dependencies,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 164.46,
          "end": 166.56,
          "en": "and then npm run dev thereafter",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 166.56,
          "end": 168.393,
          "en": "to start the development server.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 169.23,
          "end": 170.85,
          "en": "This will not be required",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 170.85,
          "end": 173.79,
          "en": "if you're using the CodeSandbox solution.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 173.79,
          "end": 176.37,
          "en": "And then you'll have a starting project",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 176.37,
          "end": 180.21,
          "en": "that in the end renders this webpage here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 180.21,
          "end": 183.48,
          "en": "Now, please note that this webpage here won't work,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 183.48,
          "end": 187.38,
          "en": "clicking Create a new account doesn't do anything.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 187.38,
          "end": 190.2,
          "en": "And if you do enter valid credentials up here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 190.2,
          "end": 194.52,
          "en": "and you click Sign in, also nothing happens.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 194.52,
          "end": 198.69,
          "en": "But, for example, if you enter invalid credentials,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 198.69,
          "end": 200.85,
          "en": "and you try to sign in with those,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 200.85,
          "end": 205.56,
          "en": "you'll see that these invalid input fields get highlighted,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 205.56,
          "end": 209.61,
          "en": "that they get a red background color and a red border,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 209.61,
          "end": 211.41,
          "en": "so that we got some styles here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 211.41,
          "end": 213.78,
          "en": "that are applied conditionally.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 213.78,
          "end": 216.87,
          "en": "And, of course, in general, you can, of course, tell",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 216.87,
          "end": 220.65,
          "en": "that this webpage already got some styles applied to it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 220.65,
          "end": 223.26,
          "en": "even though it's just the starting project.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 223.26,
          "end": 227.79,
          "en": "But at the moment, this page is simply using Vanilla CSS,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.79,
          "end": 229.98,
          "en": "it's using one CSS file",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 229.98,
          "end": 232.47,
          "en": "that then applies styles to the entire page,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 232.47,
          "end": 235.563,
          "en": "and that's what we'll get started with in the next lecture.",
          "zh": ""
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "errors": []
}